OL,3,GNEWSAFamily plea for witnesses after
OL,4,Awoman found on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who police said
OL,7,Fwas set on fire outside her home have
OL,8,Fmade a plea for witnesses to come
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FBrenda Raymond, 80, remains in a
OL,12,Fcritical condition in hospital after
OL,13,Fshe was found alight in Caractacus
OL,14,FCottage View, Watford, on Monday.
OL,16,FHertfordshire Police said she sustained
OL,17,F"catastrophic injuries" and detectives
OL,18,Fhave been treating the case as an
OL,19,Fattempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
