OL,3,GNEWSAFamily plea for witnesses after
OL,4,Awoman found on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer family said in a statement: "We
OL,7,Fsimply cannot understand why anyone
OL,8,Fwould have wanted to hurt her in this
OL,9,Fway."
